---
### NAME

    _ok()

### SYNOPSIS

    varargs int _ok( mixed args... );

### PARAMETERS

    tp    (STD_PLAYER)
          The target object to receive the message.

    str   (string)
          The confirmation message.

    args  (mixed, optional)
          Optional arguments to format the message.

    str   (string)
          The confirmation message.

    args  (mixed, optional)
          Optional arguments to format the message.

### RETURN VALUES

    (int) Always returns 1, unless there is no previous object.
